<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-MINALI WINS TOUR DE FRANCE FOURTH STAGE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MINALI WINS TOUR DE FRANCE FOURTH STAGE.</headline>
<dateline>LE PUY-DU-FOU, France 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicola Minali of Italy won the 223-km fourth stage of the Tour de France cycling race from Plumelec to Le Puy-du-Fou on Wednesday, according to provisional results after a photo finish.  </p>
<p>Italian Mario Cipollini retained the race leader's yellow jersey.</p>
